        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DCM315, Utilitarian Mirror Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple angle pull can be used or sliding cabinet doors, sliding mirror doors, sliding drawers, or even swinging cabinet doors. Available in your choice of 9 different finish colors. It measures 1-1/2 inches long and 3 inches wide. The contemporary design, with its simplicity, makes it easy to maintain and keep clean. It is great for businesses where sanitation is important like the offices of dentists and doctors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-DCM315-1-size.gif?v=1774586634\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DCM315 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/small-cabinet-pull-deltana-dcm115\"><b>Deltana  DCM115 Small Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/medium-cabinet-drawer-mirror-pull-deltana-dcm215\"><b>Deltana DCM215 Medium Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DCM315 Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DCM315-1.pdf?v=1774586634\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  DCM315 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
